    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In charge of a junkyard, you have the opportunity to create a scrap empire. Buy cars, dismantle them to extract valuable parts, and sell them on the market. Every decision is crucial to find the perfect balance, maximizing your profits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281630/extras/6cfbc5094bbd5333a6ed9ce80441f7b0.avif?t=1740912409\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management</strong>: Manage your operations, make smart decisions about what to sell or store, and optimize the workflow of your junkyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading and Profit</strong>: Sell parts or scrap, and keep an eye on market opportunities to maximize your earnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong>: Work with a variety of cars, from common models to rare finds, each with unique parts and varying values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment</strong>: Upgrade your equipment to make it more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Discover abandoned cars and hidden parts.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In charge of a junkyard, you have the opportunity to create a scrap empire. Buy cars, dismantle them to extract valuable parts, and sell them on the market. Every decision is crucial to find the perfect balance, maximizing your profits.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281630/extras/6cfbc5094bbd5333a6ed9ce80441f7b0.avif?t=1740912409\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management</strong>: Manage your operations, make smart decisions about what to sell or store, and optimize the workflow of your junkyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading and Profit</strong>: Sell parts or scrap, and keep an eye on market opportunities to maximize your earnings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong>: Work with a variety of cars, from common models to rare finds, each with unique parts and varying values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment</strong>: Upgrade your equipment to make it more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Discover abandoned cars and hidden parts.</p>",
    "short_description": "Manage a junkyard and turn scrap into wealth! Buy cars, dismantle them, sell the parts, and build your scrap empire.",
